By the end of the movie, Enola exposes the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.620
conspiracy that Mr Lyon and Lord McIntyre,&nbsp;
have been covering up the deaths of workers&nbsp;&nbsp;

